Temporary Special Events, when allowed, shall meet the following requirements:
(a) Shall comply with applicable regulations set forth in Chapter 6, Article 3 (Alcoholic Beverages) of the Code of Ordinances, if alcohol is to be available or sold;
(b) Shall be associated with and shall be to benefit the cause of a charitable or civic organization held out to the public by a bona-fide non-profit organization as defined by sections 501(c)(3), 501(d), or 501(e) of the Internal Revenue Code;
